/**
 * @defgroup stdio_stream_api stdio_stream API
 * @ingroup stream_family_group
 *
 * @brief Standard-stream-backed adapter for the `stream` port.
 *
 * @details
 * The `stdio_stream` adapter implements the `stream` port using the process
 * standard I/O streams (`stdin`, `stdout`, and `stderr`) as internal borrowed
 * dependencies.
 *
 * This module belongs to the `stream` adapter family and provides the
 * functionality required to expose standard I/O streams through the
 * `stream` port without taking ownership of them.
 *
 * Sub-APIs:
 * - @ref stdio_stream_cr_api
 */
